From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pegboard <noreply@pegboard.invalid>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:28:20 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] devtools-pipe-fds.patch

Lets the embedder run content's DevTools pipe handler on descriptors of its
choice and run it again after it stopped, so the browser can hand pegboardd
(its own child, //pegboard/bootstrap) a pipe and give a restarted daemon a
new one (design 4.2, F8). The message format is the existing pipe's
(NUL-terminated JSON). --remote-debugging-pipe (fds 3 and 4) is unchanged.

The descriptors stay the caller's: the handler never closes them (it only
calls shutdown(), which does nothing on a pipe), so the caller replaces them
once the handler is stopped (daemon_launcher.cc).

Upstream files:
- content/public/browser/devtools_agent_host.h: declares
  StartRemoteDebuggingPipeHandlerWithFds.
- content/browser/devtools/devtools_agent_host_impl.cc: defines it, the
  existing handler on the given descriptors.
---
 content/browser/devtools/devtools_agent_host_impl.cc | 9 +++++++++
 content/public/browser/devtools_agent_host.h         | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/content/browser/devtools/devtools_agent_host_impl.cc b/content/browser/devtools/devtools_agent_host_impl.cc
index 44ffa91fcac7..df711ac39b02 100644
--- a/content/browser/devtools/devtools_agent_host_impl.cc
+++ b/content/browser/devtools/devtools_agent_host_impl.cc
@@ -234,6 +234,15 @@ void DevToolsAgentHost::StartRemoteDebuggingPipeHandler(
       read_fd, write_fd, std::move(on_disconnect)));
 }
 
+// static
+void DevToolsAgentHost::StartRemoteDebuggingPipeHandlerWithFds(
+    int read_fd,
+    int write_fd,
+    base::OnceClosure on_disconnect) {
+  SetDevToolsPipeHandler(std::make_unique<DevToolsPipeHandler>(
+      read_fd, write_fd, std::move(on_disconnect)));
+}
+
 // static
 void DevToolsAgentHost::StopRemoteDebuggingServer() {
   SetDevToolsHttpHandler(nullptr);
diff --git a/content/public/browser/devtools_agent_host.h b/content/public/browser/devtools_agent_host.h
index f4aa39408926..c32e28149b35 100644
--- a/content/public/browser/devtools_agent_host.h
+++ b/content/public/browser/devtools_agent_host.h
@@ -154,6 +154,12 @@ class CONTENT_EXPORT DevToolsAgentHost
   // Starts remote debugging for browser target for the given fd=3
   // for reading and fd=4 for writing remote debugging messages.
   static void StartRemoteDebuggingPipeHandler(base::OnceClosure on_disconnect);
+  // The same on the given descriptors, which stay the caller's. It replaces a
+  // running handler, and can start again after StopRemoteDebuggingPipeHandler.
+  static void StartRemoteDebuggingPipeHandlerWithFds(
+      int read_fd,
+      int write_fd,
+      base::OnceClosure on_disconnect);
   static void StopRemoteDebuggingPipeHandler();
 
   // Observer is notified about changes in DevToolsAgentHosts.
